==============================================================================
PART 1.  THE MECHANISM: C1'S EXCISION IS WHAT CREATES THE ORBIT LABELS.
==============================================================================
   The free rotor. Phase space (theta, omega). Flow: theta' = omega, omega' = 0.
   Where does this flow STOP? Speed = |theta'| + |omega'| = |omega|. It stops
   exactly on the line omega = 0 -- and NOWHERE else. That line is the entire
   fixed-point set. C1 forbids it. So C1 DELETES THE LINE omega = 0.

      omega  flow speed |omega|   C1-legal?
      -2.00              2.0000        True
      -1.50              1.5000        True
      -1.00              1.0000        True
      -0.50              0.5000        True
       0.00              0.0000       False
       0.50              0.5000        True
       1.00              1.0000        True
       1.50              1.5000        True
       2.00              2.0000        True

   Now: with that line deleted, is the phase space still connected? Try to walk
   from omega = +1 to omega = -1 along ANY continuous path. Executed over 2000
   random continuous paths (random smooth interpolants, no constraints):

   over 2000 random continuous paths from omega=+1 to omega=-1:
     the LARGEST 'min |omega| along the path' found = 2.42e-09
     -> EVERY path touches omega = 0. Every path crosses the wall.
   a path that STAYS on one side: min |omega| = 0.7000  (legal)

   THE FIXED-POINT SET IS THE WALL. Deleting it splits the space in two, and
   sign(omega) -- the HANDEDNESS -- becomes a topological invariant of the flow.

   Apply Part II's three membership tests to sign(omega):
     (i)   does violating it break legality?              NO  (a left-handed
                                                              universe is legal)
     (ii)  invariant under ALL legal motion, yet
           multiple values legal?                          YES
     (iii) can legal motion change it?                     NO
   ==> HANDEDNESS IS A SELECTOR. Not forced. Not chosen. An ORBIT LABEL.

   And the general mechanism, now visible:
     SELECTORS = the labels of the components of (state space MINUS fixed points).
   Part II *measured* the partition. This is the reason it exists.

